### Dispatch Resume Method (Java)

Source: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/LocalActivityManager

Propagates the onResume event from the host Activity to the LocalActivityManager. This allows the manager to resume the activities it holds, ensuring they are in an active state.

```Java
public void dispatchResume ()
```

--------------------------------

### Dispatch Pause Method (Java)

Source: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/LocalActivityManager

Propagates the onPause event from the host Activity to the LocalActivityManager. This enables the manager to pause the activities it holds, with an option to handle finishing of the parent activity.

```Java
public void dispatchPause (boolean finishing)
```

